    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="44px 28px 28px"><mj-column><mj-text color="#18181b" font-size="30px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.2">Something useful is here</mj-text><mj-text color="#52525b" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6">Share the most important news first, then explain how it helps your reader in a sentence or two.</mj-text><mj-button align="left" background-color="#4f46e5" border-radius="6px" href="https://example.com">See what’s new</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section>
